flowchart TD
  S[Start with L1 Results] --> R{Rule matched in routing table?}
  R -->|Yes| O[Apply route from rule]
  R -->|No| I{Injection score >= hard threshold?}
  I -->|Yes| P[PAUSE]
  I -->|No| F{Flag count >= threshold?}
  F -->|Yes| E[ESCALATE]
  F -->|No| Q{Risk score >= pause threshold?}
  Q -->|Yes| P
  Q -->|No| G{Any single flagged score >= single-agent threshold?}
  G -->|Yes| E
  G -->|No| H{Risk score >= escalate threshold?}
  H -->|Yes| E
  H -->|No| A[PASS]
  O --> Z[Finalize]
  A --> Z
  E --> Z
  P --> Z
